          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_The young trolls spotted a huge tree within the underground forest. This was one of the great woses, the guardians of the grove, and it glared menacingly at the stone creatures who it believed were threatening saplings.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_Ougl was quick to guess that the death of any Elder Wose would only further enrage the treefolk, and resolved to keep his distance from them.</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
