          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_With the death of one of the three great guardians of the grove, the woses went into a frenzy. The trolls, helpless in the face of these strange new creatures, knew it was their end.</i>"),
