          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_The awakened Wose Shaman spoke to Ougl in a strange way, and Ougl understood. The Wose’s name was Ommm, and it was the leader of the tree folk.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_Ommm used a mysterious magic to see the purpose of the troll’s journey, and whether they had evil intentions towards the green grove.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_It soon realized that the trolls were not to blame for the unfortunate skirmish.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "OM",
            text: _("<b>_O m m m...?</b>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
