            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "OL",
            text: _("<b>_Ougl...</b>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "OM",
            text: _("<b>_O m m m...</b>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_Ougl wanted to travel further upwards, but the Wose Shaman advised him against it. The woses warned that the surface held many creatures who were not guided by goodness of heart, but by the law of strength.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_But Ougl had seen green lands now, and he began to dream of seeing more. The higher he climbed, the more green there would be.</i>"),
